| ---------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |
| Scope            | Generic multiple APIs          | Specific API (OpenAI)                 |
| LLM Role         | Central reasoning + API caller | Works alongside API (hybrid setup)    |
| APIs Shown       | Many APIs (Weather, DB, etc.)  | Only OpenAI API                       |
| Architecture     | LLM uses orchestration layer   | Local model connected to external API |

